#. Tag: para
#: accessibility.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>KMouseTool</application> is a &kde; program, which clicks the "
"mouse for you, so you do not have to. <application>KMouseTool</application> "
"works with any mouse or pointing device."
msgstr ""

